{{Quote|''He's been probing the Imperial power station at Spellhaus. He's found a weakness in the defenses. It may take some time to work up, but he's got an angle.|Luthen Rael|<ref name="Narkina 5" />}}
An '''Imperial power station''' was located on [[Spellhaus]]. The site was the target of a [[Anto Kreegyr's group|group]] of rebels led by [[Anto Kreegyr]]. In preparation for the assault on the power station, Kreegyr was supported by [[Luthen Rael]], who also offered [[Saw Gerrera]] and his [[Partisans]] the chance to help, although they declined.<ref name="Narkina 5" /> The [[Imperial Security Bureau]] would eventually learn of the rebel attack and prepared effective countermeasures, something that was discovered by Rael via an [[Lonni Jung|inside man]]. Later, Gerrera would approach Rael and offer his help despite his earlier refusal, but Rael told him of the situation and he and Gerrera agreed to let Kreegyr and his men [[Spellhaus attack|attack]] the station regardless so as to not cause suspicion and give their own operations more leeway. Kreegyr and his men would all perish in the attack.<ref name="Daughters">{{Andor|Daughter of Ferrix}}</ref>

